# Recommended ignore for host runDir / eval-measure artifacts
# (output/) and the artifact directory GitLab CI uploads (fullsend-artifact/).
# Not installed as a root .gitignore —
# CollectGitLabPerRepoInstallFiles skips this file so it cannot overwrite
# a consumer's existing ignore list. Copy the lines below into your repo
# .gitignore (or rely on fullsend run's UploadDir + .git/info/exclude).
output/
fullsend-artifact/
